# UI style guidelines

Source of truth for tokens: `@theme` in `src/renderer/src/assets/index.css`.
Shared control classes: `src/renderer/src/ui/classes.js` (`iconBtn`, `btn`, `btnPrimary`, `btnGhost`, `fieldLabel`, `fieldControl`, `card`, `chip`).
Compose conditional classes with `cn()` from `src/renderer/src/ui/cn.js`.

Style UI with Tailwind utilities. Do not add component CSS files or plain CSS rules.

## Icons

Use `lucide-react`. Draw a custom icon only when the user asks for one.

## Tokens (use these — do not invent parallel palettes)

- **Ink:** `text-ink` (primary text), `text-ink-soft` (secondary/meta)
- **Surfaces:** `bg-surface` (cards/panels), `bg-cream` / `bg-cream-deep` (page wash)
- **Accent:** `bg-coral` / `text-coral-deep` (primary actions, “in progress”)
- **Secondary accent:** `bg-teal` / `text-teal-soft` (success/done, project marks)
- **Chips only:** `bg-chip-programs`, `border-chip-programs-border`, `text-chip-programs-text` (programs / in-progress labels), `bg-chip-status`, `border-chip-status-border`, `text-chip-status-text` (done/status labels)
- **Radii:** `rounded-sm` controls, `rounded-md` content cards, `rounded-lg` columns/large cards, `rounded-full` filters/search/segmented only
- **Shadows:** `shadow-card` default, `shadow-lift` hover, `shadow-panel` overlays, `shadow-focus` coral focus ring
- **Fonts:** `font-display` (Nunito) titles, `font-body` (Outfit) UI copy
- **Motion:** `ease-pop`, about `duration-[120ms]`

Hairline borders are `border border-ink/10`.

## Content cards (course cards, kanban project cards, stat cards)

- `bg-surface`, `border border-ink/10`, `rounded-md` or `rounded-lg`, `shadow-card`
- Title in ink + `font-display`; meta/notes in `text-ink-soft`
- Hover: slight lift (`-translate-y-px` + `shadow-lift`), coral focus ring when focused
- Do not paint the whole card with chip colors or use `rounded-full` on multi-line content cards
- Status on a card: left accent border or a small chip/badge — never a full pink/teal card wash
- If status is already shown by column/context (e.g. kanban), omit redundant status text on the card

## Chips & filters

- Pill radius is for compact controls (search, segmented, filter pills, status badges)
- Chip background colors are for labels/filters only, not card containers

## Panels & forms (project panel, drawers)

- Page/panel wash: cream + subtle coral/teal radial washes (match library hub)
- Header: muted surface + thin border (like app header / kanban header)
- Inputs: `fieldControl` (surface fill, thick border, `rounded-sm`, coral focus ring)
- Field labels: `fieldLabel`

## Buttons

- Prefer `btn`, `btnPrimary`, `btnGhost`, `iconBtn`, `iconBtnGhost` from `classes.js`
- Compact actions inside cards: `btnCompact`, no heavy shadow

## Motion

- Prefer `ease-pop` for card hover/press; keep transitions short (~120–150ms)
- Do not add glow effects, multi-layer decorative shadows, or emoji as UI chrome
